/*Intro (With Kayden)*/
    <<if $OCKaydenBabysit.Active == 1 && ["PreDin", "PostDin"].includes($OCKaydenBabysit.State)>>
    While <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> is distracted by some childish commercial on the TV in the living room, you turn your attention to the myriad of pictures that line the hallway. There are a lot of photos, more than you’d expect, but it makes sense considering how big their hallway is and how often they must find themselves in front of a camera. So, you take a second to look around. <br>

/*Intro (Kayden Occupied)*/
<<else>>
    With <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> taken care of for the time being, you begin to wander around the hallway and turn your attention to the myriad of pictures that line the hallway. There are a lot of photos, more than you’d expect, but it makes sense considering how big their hallway is and how often they must find themselves in front of a camera. So, you take a second to look around. <br>
<</if>>

